                <mxCell id="aWQv6UJ750VzHTLOqWvk-31" value="Sum of all active allocations must be less than 100%. It&#39;s perfectly acceptable for a portion of the goal to be unconstrained (e.g., 20% Fixed Income and that&#39;s all).&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;There should only be one active target per AccountAssetClass at any given time.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=0;fontSize=10;" parent="wVVx1cMErQA-93AqkkJT-1" vertex="1">
